{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvajLjVHSSdC8sDcgWJF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Don't remove it yet. The data can't support that decision.**\n\n- **The 4% is probably an undercount.** Five of 14 days (about 36%) of usage events are missing. If \"tried it\" comes from those events, the true figure is higher. If the outage hit one platform or client version, the number is also biased, not just smaller.\n- **There's no baseline.** Nobody has said whether 4% is low. It's a two-week \"tried it\" rate for a feature that 10% of users can see. That depends on how discoverable it is, and scheduling is an occasional task. A comparable past launch would give you a benchmark, or you could set a target before looking at the numbers.\n- **\"Tried\" isn't the metric that matters.** Repeat use, and whether scheduled events were kept, are better signals of value than first clicks.\n\n**What I'd do:**\n1. Backfill the five missing days from a source that wasn't affected, such as server logs or the calendar database. Events created by auto-scheduling may be recoverable there.\n2. Break the funnel down into saw it, tried it, used it again, and kept the result. A weak spot in that funnel would show whether the problem is discovery, trust, or value.\n3. Agree on success criteria with the team lead before the next read. For example: \"X% repeat use among triers by day 30.\"\n4. Hold at 10% for another 2–4 weeks with a working pipeline, and add an alert so a logging outage doesn't go unnoticed again.\n5. Talk to a few users who tried it and a few who didn't.\n\nAlso weigh the cost of keeping the feature against the cost of removing it. If the maintenance burden is high, say so now. That is a legitimate reason to cut it, but this data isn't."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3454,"cache_read_input_tokens":4979,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3454},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6a15663-6ce4-4dc7-881e-14c62e51e526","uuid":"8c381b11-e943-4f4b-95ab-080687e5a39a","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:09:23.585Z","request_id":"req_011CfvajLVrUodHJEtRaHQNi"}
